alse,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Nv4+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8d1808c0-f640-4358-a787-22b83d9320ca","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"使い勝手は差がないと思います。ただtelescopeはまだ荒削りなところもあるので。（選択行のカーソルがよく消える、複数ページに結果がなったときにそれが選択できない等）","ts":"1618537078.205600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vdT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3d960ea9-3517-4ca1-9044-897c600ca953","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"拡張性のインターフェイスとかは抜きにして、実際のUIと使い勝手","ts":"1618537001.204000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DZFGU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a0570005-f2d9-444f-b29e-50f070176282","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"\u003c@U7B4ZD49X\u003e 体感でいいんですけど、FF部分自体の出来ってfzfとtelescopeでどっちが優れてるってありますか？","ts":"1618536980.203400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6ss2T"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2ecd07d8-c4c2-4994-938d-5142944ff068","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"うーん、でもfzf前提でオプション組み立てるとことか密結合してるからやっぱり時間かかるかも","ts":"1618536943.202800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"i76Ff"}]},{"client_msg_id":"de979ac7-4469-43ee-9a1e-1e5c82a6121c","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"callbackでtelescope起動するようになっちゃうと思うので","ts":"1618536912.202400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZTMD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cc357e91-a03e-4ee7-ab11-fe6fc6e42402","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"包めばいけるか、ただそれだとfzf-previewと同じように1回閉じて開き直しになっちゃいますよね","ts":"1618536837.201900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gA2g"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f84a7cdd-a78e-4db3-9bd9-1f5be3ba8a23","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"ない気がします。けどユーザー側で包めばいけるっちゃいけますね","ts":"16185368